<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>EPFL Parking — Confirmation</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f6f7;
      color: #222;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 24px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .header {
      background: #cc0000;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 20px;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 22px 24px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #cc0000;
    }

    p {
      margin: 12px 0;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: #e6e6e6;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-spacing: 5px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    table td {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: left;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    table th {
      background: #e8e8e8;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .footer {
      background: #fafafa;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #666;
    }

    a.link {
      color: #cc0000;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      .header { padding: 14px; }
      .content { padding: 16px; }
      .container { margin: 12px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container" role="article">
    <div class="header" role="banner">
      <div class="brand">EPFL Parking</div>
    </div>

    <div class="content" role="main">
      <!-- FRANÇAIS -->
      <h1>Confirmation d'autorisation</h1>

      <p>
        Bonjour,<br><br>
        Nous vous confirmons par ce message l’attribution de l’autorisation
        de parking suivante à votre nom.
      </p>

      <p>
        Si cette autorisation n’est pas limitée dans le temps, vous recevrez
        un autre email dès qu’une date de fin aura été définie.
      </p>

      <p>Meilleures salutations,<br>Le service parking de l’EPFL</p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h1>Détails de la transaction</h1>

      <table>
        <tr><th>Montant total payé</th><td>02,50 CHF</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Moyen de paiement</th><td>CAMIPRO</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Numéro de transaction</th><td>1234567</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Date de transaction</th><td>01.09.2026 13:37</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Véhicule(s) actif(s) actuel(s)</th><td>OUTATIME</td></tr>
      </table>

      <div style="height:16px;"></div>

      <h1>Autorisations</h1>

      <table>
        <tr>
          <th>Début</th>
          <th>Fin</th>
          <th>Type</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>09.09.2026 08:00</td>
          <td>09.09.2026 18:00</td>
          <td>Verte</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <p style="margin-top:16px;">
        Numéro TVA : <strong>CHE-116.075.613</strong>
      </p>
      <p><strong>Merci pour votre achat.</strong></p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <!-- ENGLISH -->
      <h1>Authorization Confirmation</h1>

      <p>
        Hello,<br><br>
        We hereby confirm that the following parking authorization has been
        assigned to your name.
      </p>

      <p>
        If this authorization does not yet have a defined end date, you will
        receive another email as soon as the end date is set.
      </p>

      <p>Best regards,<br>The EPFL Parking Service</p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <!-- Signature identical -->
      <div>
        <strong>Le service parking EPFL / EPFL Parking Service</strong><br><br>

        <strong>Site internet / Website :</strong>
        <a class="link" href="http://parking.epfl.ch" target="_blank">
          parking.epfl.ch
        </a><br>

        <strong>Questions parking :</strong>
        <a class="link" href="mailto:parking@epfl.ch">parking@epfl.ch</a><br>

        <strong>Questions techniques (Campus / MyCamipro) :</strong>
        <a class="link" href="mailto:1234@epfl.ch">1234@epfl.ch</a><br><br>

        <strong>Guichet des parkings :</strong> Lun–Ven, 07:30–12:00<br>
        <strong>Desk location :</strong>
        <a class="link"
           href="https://plan.epfl.ch/?room=%3DBS%20082"
           target="_blank">BS 082</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div>
        <strong>Important :</strong> cet e-mail est généré automatiquement —
        merci de ne pas y répondre.
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12px; color:#777;">
        © EPFL Parking —
        <a class="link" href="http://parking.epfl.ch" target="_blank">
          parking.epfl.ch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
